{
 "lessonId": "lesson-24-npm-vite",
 "allow": [
  "sh",
  "json",
  "js"
 ],
 "topic": {
  "ru": "npm, Vite и модули",
  "uz": "npm, Vite va modullar",
  "en": "npm, Vite and modules"
 },
 "sections": {
  "2": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Запуск проекта",
    "uz": "Loyihani ishga tushirish",
    "en": "Running the project"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Создадим проект на Vite и запустим.",
    "uz": "Vite da loyiha yaratib, ishga tushiramiz.",
    "en": "Let's create a Vite project and run it."
   },
   "files": {
    "terminal.sh": "# Пиши команды по одной на строку\n"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "terminal.sh",
     "re": "^\\s*npm\\s+create\\s+vite@latest",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`npm create vite@latest my-app`",
      "uz": "`npm create vite@latest my-app`",
      "en": "`npm create vite@latest my-app`"
     },
     "show": "npm create vite@latest my-app",
     "flags": "im"
    },
    {
     "file": "terminal.sh",
     "re": "^\\s*cd\\s+[\\w-]+\\s*$",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Зайди в папку: `cd my-app`",
      "uz": "Papkaga kir: `cd my-app`",
      "en": "Go into the folder: `cd my-app`"
     },
     "show": "cd my-app",
     "flags": "im"
    },
    {
     "file": "terminal.sh",
     "re": "^\\s*npm\\s+(install|i)\\s*$",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Установи зависимости: `npm install`",
      "uz": "Bog'liqliklarni o'rnat: `npm install`",
      "en": "Install dependencies: `npm install`"
     },
     "show": "npm install",
     "flags": "im"
    },
    {
     "file": "terminal.sh",
     "re": "^\\s*npm\\s+run\\s+dev\\s*$",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Запусти: `npm run dev`",
      "uz": "Ishga tushir: `npm run dev`",
      "en": "Run it: `npm run dev`"
     },
     "show": "npm run dev",
     "flags": "im"
    }
   ],
   "open": "terminal.sh"
  },
  "3": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "import и export",
    "uz": "import va export",
    "en": "import and export"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Вынесем функцию в отдельный модуль.",
    "uz": "Funksiyani alohida modulga chiqaramiz.",
    "en": "Let's move a function into its own module."
   },
   "files": {
    "math.js": "",
    "main.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "math.js",
     "re": "export\\s+(function\\s+sum|const\\s+sum\\s*=)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "В math.js: `export function sum(a, b) { return a + b; }`",
      "uz": "math.js da: `export function sum(a, b) { return a + b; }`",
      "en": "In math.js: `export function sum(a, b) { return a + b; }`"
     },
     "show": "export function sum(a, b) {\n  return a + b;\n}"
    },
    {
     "file": "main.js",
     "re": "import\\s*\\{\\s*sum\\s*\\}\\s*from\\s*[\"\\']\\./math\\.js[\"\\']",
     "say": {
      "ru": "В main.js: `import { sum } from \"./math.js\";`",
      "uz": "main.js da: `import { sum } from \"./math.js\";`",
      "en": "In main.js: `import { sum } from \"./math.js\";`"
     },
     "show": "import { sum } from \"./math.js\";\nconsole.log(sum(2, 3));"
    }
   ],
   "open": "math.js"
  }
 },
 "homework": {
  "title": {
   "ru": "Скрипты и коммит",
   "uz": "Skriptlar va kommit",
   "en": "Scripts and a commit"
  },
  "intro": {
   "ru": "Проверь скрипты в package.json и залей обновлённый проект на GitHub новым коммитом.",
   "uz": "package.json dagi skriptlarni tekshir va yangilangan loyihani yangi kommit bilan GitHub ga yukla.",
   "en": "Check the scripts in package.json and push the updated project to GitHub with a new commit."
  },
  "files": {
   "package.json": "{\n  \"name\": \"my-app\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \n  }\n}\n",
   "terminal.sh": "# Пиши команды по одной на строку\n"
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "file": "package.json",
    "re": "\"scripts\"\\s*:\\s*\\{[^}]*\"dev\"\\s*:\\s*\"vite\"",
    "say": {
     "ru": "В scripts: `\"dev\": \"vite\"`",
     "uz": "scripts ichida: `\"dev\": \"vite\"`",
     "en": "In scripts: `\"dev\": \"vite\"`"
    },
    "show": "\"dev\": \"vite\",\n\"build\": \"vite build\""
   },
   {
    "file": "package.json",
    "re": "\"scripts\"\\s*:\\s*\\{[^}]*\"build\"\\s*:\\s*\"vite build\"",
    "say": {
     "ru": "И `\"build\": \"vite build\"`",
     "uz": "Va `\"build\": \"vite build\"`",
     "en": "And `\"build\": \"vite build\"`"
    },
    "show": "\"build\": \"vite build\""
   },
   {
    "file": "terminal.sh",
    "re": "git\\s+add[\\s\\S]*git\\s+commit\\s+-m\\s+[\"\\'][^\"\\']{3,}[\"\\'][\\s\\S]*git\\s+push",
    "say": {
     "ru": "`git add .` → `git commit -m \"…\"` → `git push`",
     "uz": "`git add .` → `git commit -m \"…\"` → `git push`",
     "en": "`git add .` → `git commit -m \"…\"` → `git push`"
    },
    "show": "git add .\ngit commit -m \"Перенёс проект на Vite\"\ngit push"
   }
  ],
  "open": "package.json"
 }
}
